                <pb facs="0713" n="615" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg615"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Declaration by the Republic of China in Regard to
                        Increasing the Revenues of the Wine and Tobacco Administration</hi></head>
                <p>Supplementing and in consideration of the agreement made this twenty-sixth day of
                    November, 1919, between the Republic of China and the Pacific Development
                    Corporation, the Republic of China anticipates such an increase in the revenues
                    of the Wine and Tobacco Administration as shall justify the making of loans on
                    the security of the revenue of that Administration in excess of the loan made
                    and the option granted in said agreement of November 26th and the Republic of
                    China hereby grants to the Pacific Development Corporation the option of making
                    an additional loan or loans on the security of the revenue of said Wine and
                    Tobacco Administration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Dated <placeName>Peking</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1919-11-26">November 26th,
                        1919</date>.</dateline><lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Republic of
                        China</hi>,<lb/>(Signed and Sealed by:)<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                        Prime Minister</hi>, <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chin Yun
                        Peng</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Finance</hi>,
                            <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Li Shih Hao</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Pacific Development Corporation</hi><lb/>By
                            <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. L. Stone</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Chairman of Board</hi><lb/><signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">E. B. Bruce</hi></signed><lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">President</hi></closer>
            </div>
